          "location": {
            "line": 554,
            "column": 0,
            "character_offset": 74016,
            "byte_offset_utf8": 85331
          },
          "quote": "※洛伦茨，扰动之谬到达路径终点时可令源阶方强制触发此技能"
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "file": ".cache/p3-310-boss-research/cube-complete.html",
            "revision": "436997",
            "sha256": "f7baaa02f9ea23720296d9fdb3ec6286746b54473a70f9082f08ff27c7565a5c",
            "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/源阶方?oldid=436997"
          },
          "source_selector": ".ak-card__body.skill_card[6]",
          "paragraph_index": 0,
          "location": {
            "line": 560,
            "column": 409,
            "character_offset": 74760,
            "byte_offset_utf8": 86197
          },
          "quote": "退场时，直接选中并强制击杀（跳过重生）场上的洛伦茨，扰动之谬和源阶方模块"
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "file": ".cache/p3-310-boss-research/module-complete.html",
            "revision": "440218",
            "sha256": "b8ee770bc92aad4ca0f1be83e2df863c92c26f5b176f641284f742609ac98559",
            "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/源阶方模块?oldid=440218"
          },
          "source_selector": "section#mf-section-2 table.wikitable containing 全域信息失真",
          "location": {
            "line": 313,
            "column": 0,
            "character_offset": 30428,
            "byte_offset_utf8": 34059
          },
          "quote": "技能持续1秒，技能结束时："
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "file": ".cache/p3-310-boss-research/module-complete.html",
            "revision": "440218",
            "sha256": "b8ee770bc92aad4ca0f1be83e2df863c92c26f5b176f641284f742609ac98559",
            "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/源阶方模块?oldid=440218"
          },
          "source_selector": "section#mf-section-2 table.wikitable containing 全域信息失真",
          "location": {
            "line": 313,
            "column": 0,
            "character_offset": 30428,
            "byte_offset_utf8": 34059
          },
          "quote": "①记录自身当前攻击力，随后（使用敌方阵营索敌）使全场范围内的所有我方单位（中点判定，不受迷彩制约）延迟0.8秒后受到记录攻击力20%的预计算无来源无途径法术普通伤害。"
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "file": ".cache/p3-310-boss-research/module-complete.html",
            "revision": "440218",
            "sha256": "b8ee770bc92aad4ca0f1be83e2df863c92c26f5b176f641284f742609ac98559",
            "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/源阶方模块?oldid=440218"
          },
          "source_selector": "section#mf-section-2 table.wikitable containing 全域信息失真",
          "location": {
            "line": 313,
            "column": 0,
            "character_offset": 30428,
            "byte_offset_utf8": 34059
          },
          "quote": "②令源阶方受到源阶方自身最大生命值8%的无来源真实伤害。"
        },
        {
          "source": {
            "file": ".cache/p3-310-boss-research/module-complete.html",
            "revision": "440218",
            "sha256": "b8ee770bc92aad4ca0f1be83e2df863c92c26f5b176f641284f742609ac98559",
            "url": "https://m.prts.wiki/w/源阶方模块?oldid=440218"
          },
          "source_selector": "section#mf-section-2 table.wikitable containing 全域信息失真",
